    "type": "game",
    "name": "World War Forex",
    "steam_appid": 781960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dominate the Global Markets in <i>World War Forex</i>!</strong><br>Step into a world where strategy meets high-stakes trading. <i>World War Forex</i> puts you in command of nations, alliances, and economic empires as you battle for financial supremacy. Outwit opponents, manipulate the Forex markets, and build your legacy in a game that combines the thrill of trading with the intensity of strategic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Early Access!</strong><br>Please note, <i>World War Forex</i> is in its early stages of development. While the core gameplay is functional, expect ongoing updates, new features, and improvements as we grow with community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Massive Multiplayer Battles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against unlimited players on a single server in a unique turn-based, real-time hybrid system. You\u2019ll have just 10 seconds to issue commands before the turn executes\u2014prepare for chaos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Master the Forex Market:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the in-game Forex economy. Execute smart trades, sabotage rivals, and rise as the ultimate financial superpower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Build Alliances:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge alliances with other players to protect your assets and gain strength through collaboration. Together, climb the ranks and dominate the economy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Persistent Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The war never stops. Whether online or offline, the game evolves constantly. Even if your nation falls, rebuild quickly and reclaim your glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer and Defend:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch strategic offensives or fortify your defenses. Every decision counts as you lead your nation through epic battles and ruthless economic rivalries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Join Now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an Alpha player, your input will help shape the game\u2019s development. Dive into <i>World War Forex</i>, and together, let\u2019s build the ultimate strategy game. Are you ready to rise as the undisputed economic king?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the fight. Conquer the markets. Claim your crown!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dominate the Global Markets in <i>World War Forex</i>!</strong><br>Step into a world where strategy meets high-stakes trading. <i>World War Forex</i> puts you in command of nations, alliances, and economic empires as you battle for financial supremacy. Outwit opponents, manipulate the Forex markets, and build your legacy in a game that combines the thrill of trading with the intensity of strategic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Early Access!</strong><br>Please note, <i>World War Forex</i> is in its early stages of development. While the core gameplay is functional, expect ongoing updates, new features, and improvements as we grow with community feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Massive Multiplayer Battles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against unlimited players on a single server in a unique turn-based, real-time hybrid system. You\u2019ll have just 10 seconds to issue commands before the turn executes\u2014prepare for chaos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Master the Forex Market:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the in-game Forex economy. Execute smart trades, sabotage rivals, and rise as the ultimate financial superpower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Build Alliances:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge alliances with other players to protect your assets and gain strength through collaboration. Together, climb the ranks and dominate the economy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Persistent Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The war never stops. Whether online or offline, the game evolves constantly. Even if your nation falls, rebuild quickly and reclaim your glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Conquer and Defend:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch strategic offensives or fortify your defenses. Every decision counts as you lead your nation through epic battles and ruthless economic rivalries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Join Now?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an Alpha player, your input will help shape the game\u2019s development. Dive into <i>World War Forex</i>, and together, let\u2019s build the ultimate strategy game. Are you ready to rise as the undisputed economic king?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the fight. Conquer the markets. Claim your crown!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Rule the Financial Frontier: Immerse yourself in the role of a powerful politician in a world of war and unrest. Lead your nation to prosperity through cunning forex trades and dominate the financial battlefield. Live the life of a master strategist in this innovative game",
